   "text": "The register of certificates, inspections and licences, what is overdue, and recording a renewal.",
   "step": 0,
   "url": "",
   "intro": true
  },
  {
   "start": 7.42,
   "end": 14.85,
   "text": "Safety & licences keeps every certificate, inspection and licence the mall needs, with its next due date.",
   "step": 1,
   "url": "/admin/compliance"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.85,
   "end": 22.66,
   "text": "At the top: what is overdue, what falls due soon, and tenants whose insurance is missing or expired.",
   "step": 2,
   "url": "/admin/compliance"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.66,
   "end": 28.98,
   "text": "Filter by type: civil defence, fire alarm, lifts, licences and more.",
   "step": 3,
   "url": "/admin/compliance?cat=fire_alarm"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.98,
   "end": 33.28,
   "text": "Back to everything. Overdue items come first.",
   "step": 4,
   "url": "/admin/compliance"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.28,
   "end": 39.74,
   "text": "Open an item when the test, inspection or renewal has been done.",
   "step": 5,
   "url": "/admin/compliance/items/11"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.74,
   "end": 44.92,
   "text": "Record it here: the date, the result and who did it.",
   "step": 6,
   "url": "/admin/compliance/items/11"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.81,
   "end": 56.17,
   "text": "Add the certificate number. Leave the next due date empty: it is worked out from how often it repeats.",
   "step": 8,
   "url": "/admin/compliance/items/11"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.17,
   "end": 59.44,
   "text": "Record it as done.",
   "step": 9,
   "url": "/admin/compliance/items/11"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.44,
   "end": 65.53,
   "text": "Then upload the certificate, so it is at hand when the inspector visits.",
   "step": 10,
   "url": "/admin/compliance/items/11"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.53,
   "end": 72.47,
   "text": "The 12-month calendar shows everything falling due this year, and reminders go out before each date.",
   "step": 11,
   "url": "/admin/compliance/items/11"
  }
